  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IGAD 2023 - 2026 IDDRSI SCCI 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">IGAD 2023 - 2026 IDDRSI SCCI 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med detta bidrag &#xE4;r att konsolidera genomf&#xF6;randet av IGAD&#xB4;s Initiativ f&#xF6;r motst&#xE5;ndskraft mot torkkatastrofer och h&#xE5;llbarhets genom att fortsatt st&#xE4;rka den kapaciteten i medlemsstaternas institutioner i deras utveckling av resultatbaserade system och i dess genomf&#xF6;rande d&#xE4;r planering, &#xF6;vervakning, utv&#xE4;rdering, finansiering och rapportering &#xE4;r &#xF6;verensst&#xE4;mmer och &#xE4;r resultatorienterad. 
I anv&#xE4;ndandet av resultaten av denna insats s&#xE5; ska IGAD st&#xE4;rka sin analytiska kapacitet och institutionella mekanism f&#xF6;r livsmedelss&#xE4;kerhet, n&#xE4;ringsupplysning och byggande av motst&#xE5;ndskraft i regionen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this contribution is to consolidate implementation of IGAD Drought Disaster Resilience &amp; Sustainability Initiative through further strengthening the institutional capacity of IGAD Member State institutions to develop a result-based management system where planning, monitoring, evaluation, budgeting and reporting are coherent and result oriented. In addition, IGAD will also strengthen analytical capacities and institutional mechanisms for Food Security, Nutrition Information and Resilience Building in the IGAD Region.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of the SCII project is: The resilience of communities, institutions and ecosystems in the Intergovernmental Authority on Development (IGAD) region enhanced. Phase 2 of the SCII project will address the following outcome areas:

Outcome 1: Optimized Implementation of IDDRSI Consolidated.

Outcome 2. Analytical Capacities and Institutional Mechanisms for Food Security, Nutrition Information and Resilience Building in the IGAD Region Strengthened.</narrative>
  </description>
